+(defn- skip-eol
+  "nREPL skips one end of line left on a session's *in* after every eval (interruptible_eval.clj
+  skip-stdin-newline 57-70, clojure.main/skip-if-eol), so that a later read-line does not return
+  the end of the line the eval's form was on."
